.TH JJMCP-CONFIG 5 "May 2026" "JJMCP 0.1.0" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
jjmcp-config \- local binding configuration for JohnJuliaMCP
.SH DESCRIPTION
JJMCP persists the most recent tmux binding in a JSON file at
.I .jjmcp/config.json
under the supplied
.B project_root,
or under the server current working directory if no project root is supplied.
.PP
The file is local project state.
It is not required for MCP operation; a client can always call
.B jjmcp_bind
again.
.SH FORMAT
.nf
{
  "binding": {
    "target": "%3",
    "pane_id": "%3",
    "project_root": "/path/to/project",
    "bound_at": "2026-05-05T11:30:00+0200"
  }
}
.fi
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B target
The tmux target originally supplied by the caller.
.TP
.B pane_id
The resolved tmux pane id. JJMCP prefers this for later operations.
.TP
.B project_root
The optional project root supplied by the caller.
.TP
.B bound_at
Local timestamp when the binding was created.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR jjmcp (1)
